stateDiagram-v2
    state "F-D13-025 manifest 전" as Before
    state "MANIFEST_ACCEPTED" as Manifest
    state "READY_TO_COMMIT" as Ready
    state "QUARANTINED v2" as Quarantine
    state "COMMITTED legacy v1" as Legacy
    state "digest_rejected marker" as Rejected
    state "보존 삭제 DB row 제거" as Deleted
    [*] --> Before
    Before --> Manifest: P-D13-025 capacity와 admission 통과
    Manifest --> Manifest: 일부 chunk 수신 응답은 RECEIVING
    Manifest --> Ready: 모든 chunk persisted
    Manifest --> Rejected: 완성 object digest 불일치
    Ready --> Rejected: commit digest 불일치
    Ready --> Quarantine: F-D13-028 v2 receipt 및14일
    Ready --> Legacy: F-D13-028 v1 receipt 및180일
    Quarantine --> Quarantine: REPORT 또는 TRAINING 결정은 별도 event
    Quarantine --> Deleted: 만료와 active hold 없음 또는 계정 삭제
    Legacy --> Deleted: 만료와 active hold 없음 또는 계정 삭제
    note right of Rejected
      같은 collection 쓰기 차단
      terminal expiry 후보에는 없음
    end note
